      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "One feature, one directory",
      "items": [
        "A capability owns its commands, its handlers and its own state",
        "Adding one means adding a directory, not editing a central switch",
        "The registry is the only place that has to know they all exist"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "shared/ is defined by what it may NOT do",
      "items": [
        "It holds only code with no Discord dependency — env, logging, reminders",
        "That constraint is why two workspaces survived the multi-bot removal",
        "It is not a junk drawer; it is a boundary"
      ]
    },
